Package: bentrixmcp
Type: Package
Title: BENTRIX's MCP Client for R
Version: 0.1.361
Description: Every capability of a running BENTRIX, over its Model Context Protocol endpoint: the
    client finds the application, pairs with it and calls its tools, generated from BENTRIX's
    capability catalogue. The engine in your own process is the 'bentrix' package beside it.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: curl, jsonlite, tools, utils
NeedsCompilation: no
Collate: 'generated.R' 'client.R' 'forecast.R' 'output.R'
